         Town Meeting and Election page Subscribe to Town Clerk News (includes updates for Elections, Town Meetings, Dog Licensing, etc.) Text Alert Instructions (PDF) Please call or email the office prior to making the trip over to make sure someone will be there to assist you.  The Town Clerk's office is able to accommodate most requests remotely and appreciates receiving requests via email to more efficiently process requests. Please email us if you have a request:  Email Town Clerk . Include as much information as we will need to complete/research your request, and include a phone number we can reach you at if necessary. The Clerk's office will generally process requests within 7 to 10 days, often sooner if the necessary information is provided. Vital Records Request (Birth, Marriage, Death) Request Form (PDF) Directions on How to Fill out the Form (PDF) Information to Include: Type of record (birth, marriage, death) Name of person on the record (use the name that would be on the record - example: maiden name) Date of event Number of copies to purchase ($10 per copy) Contact information for requester: Full Name. Phone Number, Email, Mailing Address Email the form to the  Town Clerk , and we can call you to process the payment over the phone. Mail the form with payment to our office. Checks payable "Town of Stow" 
     

 
